                        </div>
                        <div class="col-xl-6">
                            <div class="about-content">

                                <div class="flex-align align-items-start gap-28 mb-32" data-aos="fade-left"
                                    data-aos-duration="200">
                                    <span
                                        class="w-80 h-80 bg-main-25 border border-neutral-30 flex-center rounded-circle flex-shrink-0">
                                        <img src="assets/images/icons/about-img1.png" alt=" about image 1">
                                    </span>
                                    <div class="flex-grow-1">
                                        <h4 class="text-neutral-500 mb-12">Our Mission</h4>
                                        <p class="text-neutral-500">
                                           Our mission at PDU is to empower professionals through high-
quality online training and distance learning in project 
management, Agile and Scrum, leadership, and professional 
development—cultivating innovative, principled leaders who drive
meaningful change and advance modern management practices

                                        </p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="flex-align align-items-start gap-28 mb-0" data-aos="fade-left"
                                    data-aos-duration="400">
                                    <span
                                        class="w-80 h-80 bg-main-25 border border-neutral-30 flex-center rounded-circle flex-shrink-0">
                                        <img src="assets/images/icons/about-img2.png" alt="about image 2">
                                    </span>
                                    <div class="flex-grow-1">
                                        <h4 class="text-neutral-500 mb-12">Our Vision</h4>
                                        <p class="text-neutral-500">
                                            PDU was founded by three veterans of the US Pennsylvania Army National
                                            Guard, each of whom earned their Project Management Professional (PMP®)
                                            certification from the Project Management Institute in Newton Square,
                                            Pennsylvania. Drawing from their hands-on experience with the 2000 PMBOK®
                                            Guide 2nd Edition, they saw a need for structured, practical education that
                                            not only prepares candidates for PMP certification but also enhances their
                                            ability to apply project management principles effectively in real-world
                                            scenarios.
                                        </p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
        <section class="choose-us pt-120 position-relative z-1 mash-bg-main mash-bg-main-two">
            <img src="assets/images/shapes/shape2.png" alt="shape 2" class="shape one animation-scalation">
            <img src="assets/images/shapes/shape2.png" alt="shape 2" class="shape six animation-scalation">

            <div class="container">
                <div class="row gy-4">
                    <div class="col-xl-6">
                        <div class="choose-us__content">
                            <div class="mb-40">
                                <div class="flex-align gap-8 mb-16 wow bounceInDown">
                                    <span class="w-8 h-8 bg-main-600 rounded-circle"></span>
                                    <h5 class="text-main-600 mb-0">Why Choose PDU?</h5>
                                </div>
                                <h2 class="mb-24  wow bounceIn">Our Purpose and Values </h2>
                                <p class="text-neutral-500 mb-24 wow bounceInUp">At PDU, we recognize that obtaining a
                                    PMP certification is a significant milestone for any project manager. That’s why we
                                    offer structured programs that include PMP certification exam study tips,
                                    interactive learning modules, and industry-leading study materials. Whether you are
                                    a beginner looking to understand the PMP certification benefits or an experienced
                                    professional seeking PMP certification renewal process guidance, our courses are
                                    tailored to meet your unique learning needs
                                </p>
                                <p class="text-neutral-500  wow bounceInUp">We believe that an effective PMP
                                    certification study plan goes beyond textbooks. Our programs emphasize experiential
                                    learning, where participants engage in real-world case studies, hands-on exercises,
                                    and collaborative discussions. By integrating emerging technologies and innovative
                                    teaching methodologies, we ensure that learners not only pass their PMP
                                    certification exams but also apply their knowledge confidently in their professional
                                    roles.
                                </p>
                            </div>

